SUMMARY:Glass Blowing Workshop at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Grandview Vineyard for a glass blowing class.No experience necessary\, After a brief demonstration students will make there own Plant waterer\, Shot glass/wine sampler or seashell.\n\nWe have 2 classes available this time:\n4:30 – Introductory class\nClick Here to Purchase Tickets\n\n6:30 – Date nightClick Here to Purchase Tickets\n\nMr Peluso brings almost 30 years of glass experience to his classes. Come knowing nothing about the art of glass blowing leave with tons of knowledge and a good understanding of hot glass.\n\nYour wine sampler plant waterer or seashell will be ready at the end of class to take home.\n\nNo experience needed. After a simple demonstration guided instructions throughout the class will have you enjoying the item that you create.\n\nFor a questions contact Michael Peluso at Michael@michaelpeluso.com or 7176084661. Call/text/email\nCheck it out\nhttps://youtu.be/yEBYpWZslKs\n  \nClick Here to Purchase Tickets
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/glass-blowing-workshop-at-grandview-2/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Glass-Blowing_May.jpg
END:VEVENT
